  "summary": "Score-driven GAS-t/DCS-t are competitive-but-not-superior to GARCH-family for VaR+ES tail-risk. In HLN FZ0 MCS(90%) score-driven survive 3-4/4 asset×α cells alongside GARCH-t/GJR-t but never win outright; GAS-t weakest (SPY α=5% excluded from MCS, GARCH-t DM-beats it at SPY α=1% t=3.06); DCS-t≈GJR-t (null). EWMA-Normal excluded from every MCS -> distribution(Student-t) dwarfs dynamics(score-driven). No model passes full VaR+ES trinity; ES universally understated (Acerbi-Szekely) over 2007-2026 crisis span. Extends platform score-driven QLIKE-NULL line (K437/K1038/K1138/K1143) to tail-risk.",
